    <string name="decoy_setup_body">A decoy vault is a second, fully separate vault unlocked with a different password.\n\nUse case: if someone forces you to open Pass Tech (border, assault, control), you give the decoy password. The app then shows a fake vault — it is cryptographically impossible to prove the real one exists.\n\nKeep in mind:\n• The decoy password must differ from the real one\n• Fill the decoy with a few credible entries\n• Biometric unlock will be turned off, and stays off for as long as a decoy exists: the fingerprint opens the real vault directly, which would defeat the decoy</string>
    <!-- Shown only when a fingerprint opens THIS vault: no vault ever says anything about another (design v2.3 §1). -->
    <string name="decoy_setup_biometric_warning">Setting up a decoy vault will turn off biometric unlock. The fingerprint opens the real vault directly, so it would defeat the decoy in the very situation the decoy is for. You can still unlock with your master password.</string>
